            "id": "04198620-0c8c-3471-aed3-8b2fbef7924d",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Banking: M&A activity will see 'very rapid' boost in 2026",
            "description": "<p>Earnings season is kicking off for big banks \u2014 JPMorgan Chase (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JPM\">JPM</a>), Bank of America (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BAC\">BAC</a>), Citigroup (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/C\">C</a>), Morgan Stanley (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MS\">MS</a>), Wells Fargo (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WFC\">WFC</a>), Goldman Sachs (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GS\">GS</a>) \u2014 throughout next week. Major US bank stocks notably <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/americas-biggest-banks-are-ending-2025-on-top-with-big-growth-goals-and-markets-wide-open-070002408.html\">ended 2025 at new record highs.</a></p>\n<p>Mendon Capital senior portfolio manager Anton Schutz explains how deregulation and M&A activity could present a promising environment for the banking sector.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
